WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.813
Step three leaves one login out of the
mapping: the sequel login payroll report.

2
00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:07.807
It loads the kit's module,
reads the day-one snapshot,

3
00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:11.213
drops that row from the mapping,
and builds the plan again.

4
00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:14.410
The create script now
carries an unresolved line:

5
00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.750
map it, or record why it isn't migrated.

6
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.212
And the cutover leaves payroll report out.

7
00:00:19.212 --> 00:00:23.812
Its disable line is gone, so the login
keeps working until someone maps it.

8
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:26.330
The plan never guesses an Entra principal.
